&lt;h2 id=&#34;results--analysis&#34;&gt;Results &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The trained policy achieved a 93% success rate in simulation and generalized well to real-world settings with minor calibration.&lt;/p&gt;
